{"pageid":2483,"title":"Goblins","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Goblins</span>","revid":15181,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Goblins</b>, better known as \"<a href=\"/wiki/Greeb\" title=\"Greeb\">Greeb</a> Goblins\" are located in different places around the map. There are 22 currently discovered goblins.\n</p><p>Their main sanctuary is above <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> where they are around <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Memorabilia\" title=\"Goblin Memorabilia\">Goblin Memorabilia</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Under bridge in <a href=\"/wiki/River_Caves\" title=\"River Caves\">River Caves</a></li>\n<li>Under second big bridge in <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a></li>\n<li>Under some of bridges in <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a> - 2, one has a hat</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> - 14</li>\n<li>Under bridge at right of <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Cave_Shop\" title=\"Magma Cave Shop\">Magma Cave Shop</a> - 4, one small</li></ul>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:163px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Goblin_with_hat-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:137px; width:185px; top:12px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Goblin_with_hat.png\" title=\"Goblin with hat.png (1.47 MB)\" style=\"height:137px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://sta